{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_2_level_main_02-04_beg","groupId":"main_2","stageId":"main_02-04","title":"企鹅物流","storyCode":"2-4","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-04_beg.txt","sourceHash":"d372255faebc9aef972291e77c5312a532b08d378de00d9c9cfd69506df9c49b","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第十六关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——就是这样，陈长官。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":true,"text":"收到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":true,"text":"近卫局会保证汇合地点的安全，等候你们护送目标抵达。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"芙兰卡，把侦查小队绘制的地图给我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，这样就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我们会沿最短路径离开贫民区。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（还有其他指示吗，陈长官？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":true,"text":"动作快点。时间不等人。通话结束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":true,"text":"——收队！别磨蹭！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":true,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":".......呼，挂断了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是说，我们现在要给她跑腿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟是我们找到了目标......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"（龙门近卫局并没有向我们出示过任何目标的具体资料。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"明明是合作者，却突然向我们告知，被我们发现的感染者有重要作用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"我们缺少了许多关键信息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（......近卫局不过多透露信息是理所当然的。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"你那聪明脑瓜现在转不过来了？知道太多对罗德岛有什么好处？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"我只理解知道太少对任务有害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"总之，我们得先把米莎护送到汇合地点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"路线的选择，唔——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"又得麻烦他们了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"你是指？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"企鹅物流。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"哟，罗德岛的各位~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"任务是不是很快就完成了？“企鹅”的服务如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"——我就知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"别这么~垂头丧气的嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"是发生什么不开心的事情了？还是说，遇到了什么不喜欢的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"别这么说，没有企鹅物流的情报，罗德岛没法缩小搜索范围——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"更不可能那么轻易地掌握有关龙门感染者的各种信息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"这位小姐，多谢夸奖！你还是很识货的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"能天使，我们需要一条比较安全的路线。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就直接说结论好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......哪条都不好走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"这条，就这条，嗯，请看地图，就是从贫民区中心，向北移动三条街道，然后再向南一路向前，直到离开贫民区。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"这就算是，最安全的路线了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"然而，就算是这条路上埋伏着的敌人，也够组好几个合唱团了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"敌人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"看来整合运动确实已经渗透进了龙门。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"能天使小姐，我可不可以理解成，你已经摸清了敌人的分布？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"那，他们的行动趋势呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"正在朝你们靠拢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"我们被围堵了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"首要任务，是把米莎安全带出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"芙兰卡，针对敌人的突袭，就交给你们了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"简单。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"雷蛇，重装小队负责两翼。米莎也交由你保护。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"没问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"对了对了，敌人似乎还带了些术师哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，请牢牢跟在我身边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来也请你继续指挥小队作战，我会传达你的命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们就走这最安全的路线试试看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陈"]},{"speakerId":"char_103_angel","aliases":["能天使"]},{"speakerId":"char_106_franka","aliases":["芙兰卡"]},{"speakerId":"char_107_liskam","aliases":["雷蛇"]}]}
